he action to work. The cache has been configured to restore based on the runner's OS and architecture, so it should work on any runner.\r\n\r\n- [x] have read the [CONTRIBUTING.md](./CONTRIBUTING.md) file\r\n- [ ] raised a GitHub issue or discussed it on the projects chat beforehand\r\n- [ ] added unit tests\r\n- [ ] added integration tests\r\n- [ ] updated documentation if needed\r\n- [ ] updated CHANGELOG.md\r\n","created_at":"2025-05-09T03:25:29Z","updated_at":"2025-05-26T21:05:42Z","closed_at":"2025-05-26T21:05:09Z","merged_at":"2025-05-26T21:05:09Z","merge_commit_sha":"b8044c29ddc59d9c6346337d589b73a7e5b0511e","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"ohdearaugustin","id":14001491,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MDAxNDkx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14001491?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohdearaugustin","html_url":"https://github.com/ohdearaugustin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohdearaugustin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohdearaugustin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohdearaugustin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohdearaugustin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohdearaugustin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohdearaugustin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohdearaugustin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohdearaugustin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohdearaugustin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/2575/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/2575/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/comments{/number}